,"sd":null},{"k":"100:8","t":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense.","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"100:9","t":"But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"100:10","t":"And that within the breasts is obtained,","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"100:11","t":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Aware.","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"101:1","t":"The Striking Calamity -","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"101:2","t":"What is the Striking Calamity?","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"101:3","t":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"101:4","t":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"101:5","t":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"101:6","t":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"101:7","t":"He will be in a pleasant life.","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"101:8","t":"But as for one whose scales are light,","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"101:9","t":"His refuge will be an abyss.","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"101:10","t":"And what can make you know what that is?","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"101:11","t":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","j":30,"h":60,"s":101,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"102:1","t":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","j":30,"h":60,"s":102,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"102:2","t":"Until you visit the graveyards.","j":30,"h":60,"s":102,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"102:3","t":"No! You are going to know.","j":30,"h":60,"s":102,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"102:4","t":"Then, no! You are going to know.","j":30,"h":60,"s":102,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"102:5","t":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty...","j":30,"h":60,"s":102,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"102:6","t":"You will surely see the Hellfire.","j":30,"h":60,"s":102,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"102:7","t":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.","j":30,"h":60,"s":102,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"102:8","t":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","j":30,"h":60,"s":102,"a":8,"sd":null}],"juz":30,"hizb":60,"surahs":[100,101,102],"sajdah":false}